<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main>

  <section class="page-banner">
    <div class="page-banner__bg">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618220179428-22790b461013?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=75" alt="Warm, styled living space">
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-banner__content">
        <div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> <span>About Us</span></div>
        <h1>Why homeowners choose us.</h1>
        <p>We're a locally owned Brisbane team obsessed with getting the details right — from the first sketch to the final clean-up.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-split">
        <div class="about-split__media reveal">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552321554-5fefe8c9ef14?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=75" alt="Bright, freshly renovated bathroom with checkerboard floor tiles">
          <div class="about-split__badge">
            <span class="num">15+</span>
            <span class="label">Years Experience</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-split__content reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Our Story</span>
          <h2>Built on craftsmanship, trust and genuinely good design.</h2>
          <p>Bathroom Kitchen Home started with a simple idea: renovations should feel exciting, not stressful. For over 15 years we've partnered with homeowners across Brisbane to design and build bathrooms, kitchens and living spaces that are as functional as they are beautiful.</p>
          <p>We're small enough to care about every detail, and experienced enough to handle projects of any size — from a single vanity swap to a full home renovation.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Fixed, transparent pricing with no hidden costs</li>
            <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Dedicated project manager on every job</li>
            <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Licensed, insured and locally based tradespeople</li>
            <li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Workmanship guarantee on every renovation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head center">
        <span class="eyebrow">What Drives Us</span>
        <h2>The values behind every project.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="values-grid reveal-stagger">
        <div class="card value-card">
          <div class="value-card__icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87L18.18 21 12 17.77 5.82 21 7 14.14l-5-4.87 6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Quality First</h3>
          <p>We use trusted materials and trades, and we don't cut corners — even where you'll never see it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card value-card">
          <div class="value-card__icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4.5 8-11.8V5l-8-3-8 3v5.2C4 17.5 12 22 12 22z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Honest Advice</h3>
          <p>Straightforward pricing and realistic timelines from day one — no surprises halfway through.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card value-card">
          <div class="value-card__icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div>
          <h3>On Time, On Budget</h3>
          <p>Clear project schedules and proactive communication so you always know what's happening next.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card value-card">
          <div class="value-card__icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20.8 4.6c-1.6-1.6-4.2-1.6-5.8 0L12 7.6 9 4.6c-1.6-1.6-4.2-1.6-5.8 0-1.6 1.6-1.6 4.2 0 5.8L12 19l8.8-8.6c1.6-1.6 1.6-4.2 0-5.8z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Genuinely Local</h3>
          <p>Proudly based in Stones Corner — we live in this community and stand behind our work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head center">
        <span class="eyebrow">How It Works</span>
        <h2>A simple, guided process from start to finish.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="process-steps reveal-stagger">
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__num">01</span>
          <h3>Free Consultation</h3>
          <p>We visit your home or showroom to understand your goals, space and budget.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__num">02</span>
          <h3>Design &amp; Quote</h3>
          <p>Our designers create a concept and a fixed, transparent quote for your approval.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__num">03</span>
          <h3>Build</h3>
          <p>Our licensed trades bring the design to life, with regular updates along the way.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__num">04</span>
          <h3>Handover</h3>
          <p>A final walkthrough, thorough clean-up, and a workmanship guarantee for peace of mind.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-primary">
    <div class="container text-center reveal">
      <h2 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Ready to start your renovation?</h2>
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); max-width:560px; margin-inline:auto; margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">Tell us about your project and we'll be in touch within one business day.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--light">Get Your Free Quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
<script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
